00:06:56,470 --> 00:06:59,312
That's going to describe
the way that we want to wait.

118
00:06:59,312 --> 00:07:01,798
And whether or
not we want to wake up on signals.

119
00:07:01,798 --> 00:07:05,311
And so that will ultimately get
mapped to prepare_to_wait_event here.

120
00:07:05,311 --> 00:07:07,629
That's going to set up
that current task state,

121
00:07:07,629 --> 00:07:11,261
depending on whether the current
tasks should be interruptible or not.

122
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:15,187
And then as we mentioned before, the flag,

