126
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:30,804
And the book also mentions that the,
so one other thing to mention here.

127
00:07:30,804 --> 00:07:32,548
The schedule function as we mentioned,

128
00:07:32,548 --> 00:07:35,998
this is the one that's going to swap out
