the wait_event interruptible macro.

135
00:07:58,620 --> 00:08:01,990
So you won't ever sleep if
the condition was already satisfied.

136
00:08:01,990 --> 00:08:06,630
That's kind of like an optimization that
the kernel provides on these functions.

137
00:08:06,630 --> 00:08:09,710
And then you can see when you're
exiting the weight event status,

138
00:08:09,710 --> 00:08:13,190
we'll go back to task running state
through this finish_wait function.

139
00:08:13,190 --> 00:08:17,570
So again, if you ever want to know
