147
00:08:41,850 --> 00:08:47,770
What if when we do an open of a file
descriptor, we specify O_NONBLOCK.

148
00:08:47,770 --> 00:08:52,420
And it turns out that the open function
that we get the file pointer that's

149
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:57,071
