173
00:10:34,651 --> 00:10:39,861
So this is a way that you can test any
arbitrary driver that uses standard in and

174
00:10:39,861 --> 00:10:43,320
standard out through
a simple function like this.

175
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:46,616
That just reads whatever is passed and

176
00:10:46,616 --> 00:10:51,990
