184
00:11:25,042 --> 00:11:29,446
When the transfer is not ready
to occur because, so for

185
00:11:29,446 --> 00:11:33,961
instance if you're waiting for
a read to be available.

186
00:11:33,961 --> 00:11:37,539
Because you haven't written
